\[ \text{proj}_w v = \frac{v \cdot w}{\|w\|^2} w, \]
where $w$ is the vector representing the $y$-axis, so $w = \begin{pmatrix} 0 \\ 1 \\ 0 \\ 0 \end{pmatrix}$.

Then $v \cdot w = (0)(0) + (1)(1) + (0)(0) + (0)(0) = 1$.
Also, $\|w\|^2 = 0^2 + 1^2 + 0^2 + 0^2 = 1$.
Thus,
\[ \text{proj}_w v = \frac{1}{1} \begin{pmatrix} 0 \\ 1 \\ 0 \\ 0 \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} 0 \\ 1 \\ 0 \\ 0 \end{pmatrix}. \]
The matrix corresponding to the projection onto the $y$-axis is
